          "description": "Dark Horse composition for a compact, focused utility. Application CSS owns centering, width and placement.",
          "markup": "<section class=\"rdk-dark-horse-window\" aria-labelledby=\"dh-doc-window-title\"><header><h2 class=\"font-semibold\" id=\"dh-doc-window-title\">Display Control</h2><span class=\"rdk-dark-horse-micro-status\" data-state=\"success\">Online</span></header><div class=\"grid gap-3 p-3\"><div class=\"rdk-dark-horse-status\" data-state=\"success\"><span class=\"rdk-dark-horse-status-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"rdk-dark-horse-status-name\">Host</span><strong class=\"rdk-dark-horse-status-value\">Station 04</strong></div><label class=\"grid gap-1\" for=\"dh-doc-window-output\"><span class=\"rdk-label\">Output</span><select id=\"dh-doc-window-output\" class=\"rdk-select w-full p-2\"><option>Desk Monitor</option><option>Studio Panel</option></select></label><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3\"><label class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" for=\"dh-doc-window-hdr\">HDR <input id=\"dh-doc-window-hdr\" type=\"checkbox\" class=\"rdk-toggle\" checked></label><button type=\"button\" class=\"rdk-btn rdk-btn-primary min-h-9 px-3\">Apply</button></div></div></section>"
        },
